Algorithms implemented from specifications (no code copied): NIP-01/13/17/19/44/49/59, BIP-173 bech32,
HChaCha20 (draft-irtf-cfrg-xchacha), HKDF (RFC 5869), Shamir secret sharing over GF(2^8),
Open Location Code (Plus Codes) specification, WebSocket (RFC 6455) for the Wi-Fi room server,
PMTiles v3 (https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles/blob/main/spec/v3/spec.md), Hilbert tile ids, geohash.

Libraries linked (not copied): secp256k1-kmp (ACINQ, Apache-2.0, bundles libsecp256k1, MIT),
BouncyCastle (MIT), ZXing core (Apache-2.0), ZXing Android Embedded 4.3.0 (JourneyApps,
https://github.com/journeyapps/zxing-android-embedded, Apache-2.0; camera/decoder adapter,
no source copied), MapLibre Native Android (BSD-2-Clause,
https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native; with its MapLibre GeoJSON/Turf/gestures modules, BSD-2-Clause,
and Timber, Apache-2.0).

Map data: offline map packs are downloaded by the user, not bundled. They are cut from the Protomaps daily
build (basemap schema, BSD-3-Clause / CC0 styles) of OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
available under the Open Database License (ODbL); the app shows "(c) OpenStreetMap contributors - Protomaps"
on the map.
